# Database: Convex + Clerk (personal ledgers)

## Live source of truth

- App uses **Convex** + **Clerk**. Every private row is scoped by `userId`.
- Auth helpers: `convex/lib/auth.ts` (`requireUser` / `ensureUser`).
- Never trust client-supplied `userId`. Gate Next AI routes with Clerk `auth()`.

## Invite-only

- Keep Clerk public signup disabled; invite users from the Clerk Dashboard.
- After first sign-in, `users.ensure` + `migrations.claimUnownedData` claim pre-auth import rows.

## Legacy Turso / scripts

- `src/shared/db` + most of `scripts/` are archive tooling only.
